2 Supported files
*****************

The DICOM format is quite diverse.  Since ‘dcm2xml’ tool from the DICOM
toolkit is used to read the metadata, most uncorrupted DICOM files can
be read.  It can still happen that the DICOM viewer is unable to display
files nicely, if the metadata records are not interpreted properly.  Any
help improving the package is welcome.


